                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "338f97d9-678c-3f1b-8a2d-c08a44f5f1d8",
                        "entry_id": "8a761214-c4df-390a-8f06-c20f393aaf43",
                        "glosses": [
                            "действие по значению гл. запрещать, запрещаться, запретить, запретиться"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d93cced-6cd6-4915-a5c6-134605df2415",
                                "sense_id": "338f97d9-678c-3f1b-8a2d-c08a44f5f1d8",
                                "text": "При затянувшемся нашем бедствии на долгие годы на это имущество в чужеземных руках, как бы на вымороченное, могла какая-нибудь держава-кредитор наложить запрещение и т. д."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3f5b56cb-800a-3a3d-a375-40b5903ded7a",
                        "entry_id": "8a761214-c4df-390a-8f06-c20f393aaf43",
                        "glosses": [
                            "результат такого действия; запрет"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e2ac0a9-90b4-4a46-8981-b86bb871774e",
                                "sense_id": "3f5b56cb-800a-3a3d-a375-40b5903ded7a",
                                "text": "Запрещение стрельбы в городе было для него [Дерсу] неприятным открытием."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "62944535-f922-4bc9-989b-824574c9ef71",
                        "source_entry_id": "8a761214-c4df-390a-8f06-c20f393aaf43",
                        "source_sense_description": "действие по значению гл. запрещать, запрещаться, запретить, запретиться",
                        "target_lang_word": "prohibition",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "prohibition",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4cbf9aa-1d31-3495-bae5-947af64f056c",
                                        "entry_id": "856f95b4-0095-3182-b4f1-7478988b4607",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of prohibiting, forbidding, disallowing, or proscribing something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21a8c8fd-0a4c-428d-bd05-a4d93ca6c28d",
                                                "sense_id": "d4cbf9aa-1d31-3495-bae5-947af64f056c",
                                                "text": "By its terms, the Twenty-Second Amendment bars only the election of two-term Presidents, and this prohibition would not prevent someone who had twice been elected President from succeeding to the office after having been elected or appointed Vice President. Broader language providing that no such person \"shall be chosen or serve as President . . . or be eligible to hold the office\" was rejected in favor of the Twenty-Second Amendment’s ban merely on election. (Amdt22.1 Overview of Twenty-Second Amendment, Presidential Term Limits, The Constitution of the United States of America: Analysis and Interpretation)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59e5bfcf-2ea7-4c41-8025-9aba207dc06b",
                                                "sense_id": "d4cbf9aa-1d31-3495-bae5-947af64f056c",
                                                "text": "But the prohibition on active advocacy and participation left a wide margin of allowable activity and was open to interpretation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55ac602c-e548-41d2-b427-c15b52b0bdb3",
                                                "sense_id": "d4cbf9aa-1d31-3495-bae5-947af64f056c",
                                                "text": "Appeals courts, including the 5th Circuit, have in the past upheld the federal ban in question. But more recently, some courts have shown hostility towards gun prohibitions aimed at 18- to 20-year-olds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f54b8ed6-34ff-3881-b3d1-b3157b7fe208",
                                        "entry_id": "856f95b4-0095-3182-b4f1-7478988b4607",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A law prohibiting the manufacture or sale of alcohol."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da5a5fe8-851d-406f-9cd6-a0628d6e06dd",
                                                "sense_id": "f54b8ed6-34ff-3881-b3d1-b3157b7fe208",
                                                "text": "First, some persons might consider my advocacy of prohibition rather odd for a congressman coming from the state which produces the finest bourbon whiskey in the world. While this is true, it is also true that prior to the Eighteenth Amendment a large majority of the counties of Kentucky had voted against the sale of liquor under what was known as the county unit plan. Since repeal of the Eighteenth Amendment a substantial majority of Kentucky counties have voted under local option to outlaw liquor. My stand on the question, first in voting for the submission of the Eighteenth Amendment, and later for an amendment to appeal it, was a matter of principle and not of expediency."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2f5a002-4863-346c-a876-800cf836e719",
                                        "entry_id": "856f95b4-0095-3182-b4f1-7478988b4607",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A period of time when specific socially disapproved consumables are considered controlled substances."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
